{"id": "EUVD-2026-89111", "enisaUuid": "34ae88c7-7632-39a0-a038-893299ab7f29", "description": "Marmite through 0.4.2 contains missing authentication in the development server endpoints /__marmite__/content, /__marmite__/config, and /__marmite__/file/, allowing unauthenticated attackers to create, modify, and overwrite site content and configuration. Attackers can exploit unsanitized path parameters in handle_create_content and handle_clone_content to write files outside the project directory via directory traversal.", "datePublished": "2026-09-29T17:22:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-29T17:49:37", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite/issues/554", "https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite/blob/4b2ddbd7595233b2e1d0086e18490fec49705098/src/server.rs#L455-L475", "https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite/blob/4b2ddbd7595233b2e1d0086e18490fec49705098/src/content.rs#L1064-L1075", "https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite/blob/4b2ddbd7595233b2e1d0086e18490fec49705098/src/content.rs#L1300-L1322", "https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite/commit/303a0bf2fff4302f4164c0c39932fdffc6683ad4", "https://github.com/rochacbruno/marmite", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/marmite-through-0.4.2-unauthenticated-api-access-via-development-server"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-102811", "GHSA-j4pw-7rqh-x2mj"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.66, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "902f6571-b574-35d9-bb91-c4dc8cac1d1f", "product": {"name": "marmite", "vendor": {"name": "rochacbruno"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.4.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3a375523-ed6a-331f-9d48-eb35522ce232", "vendor": {"name": "rochacbruno"}}], "isExploited": false}